#: (2)/Documentation/windowgen-documentation-4.0/docs/source/starting_up.rst:2
#: DESKTOP-HETTM96/WindowGen
msgid "Starting Up"
msgstr "Per iniziare"

#: (2)/Documentation/windowgen-documentation-4.0/docs/source/starting_up.rst:5
#: DESKTOP-HETTM96/WindowGen
msgid "Requirements"
msgstr "Requisiti"

#: (2)/Documentation/windowgen-documentation-4.0/docs/source/starting_up.rst:7
#: DESKTOP-HETTM96/WindowGen
msgid "WindowGen 4 runs on **Blender 4.2 LTS and newer** and is tested up to Blender 5.3. It is installed as a Blender extension."
msgstr "WindowGen 4 funziona con **Blender 4.2 LTS e successive** ed è testato fino a Blender 5.3. Si installa come estensione di Blender."

#: (2)/Documentation/windowgen-documentation-4.0/docs/source/starting_up.rst:10
#: DESKTOP-HETTM96/WindowGen
msgid "Using Blender 4.0 or 4.1? Stay on WindowGen 3 and its `documentation <https://windowgen-documentation.readthedocs.io/en/3.0/>`_."
msgstr "Usi Blender 4.0 o 4.1? Resta su WindowGen 3 e sulla sua `documentazione <https://windowgen-documentation.readthedocs.io/en/3.0/>`_."

#: (2)/Documentation/windowgen-documentation-4.0/docs/source/starting_up.rst:13
#: DESKTOP-HETTM96/WindowGen
msgid "How to install WindowGen add-on"
msgstr "Come installare l'add-on WindowGen"

#: (2)/Documentation/windowgen-documentation-4.0/docs/source/starting_up.rst:15
#: DESKTOP-HETTM96/WindowGen
msgid "The quickest way is to drag the WindowGen zip archive from your file manager into the Blender window and confirm the installation. To install it from the Preferences instead, follow these steps:"
msgstr "Il modo più rapido è trascinare l'archivio zip di WindowGen dal file manager nella finestra di Blender e confermare l'installazione. Per installarlo invece dalle preferenze, segui questi passaggi:"

#: (2)/Documentation/windowgen-documentation-4.0/docs/source/starting_up.rst:17
#: DESKTOP-HETTM96/WindowGen
msgid "Click on **Edit** in the top left corner and select **Preferences…**."
msgstr "Fai clic su **Edit** in alto a sinistra e scegli **Preferences…**."

#: (2)/Documentation/windowgen-documentation-4.0/docs/source/starting_up.rst:19
#: DESKTOP-HETTM96/WindowGen
msgid "Open the **Get Extensions** section (1), click the arrow in the top right corner (2) and choose **Install from Disk…**."
msgstr "Apri la sezione **Get Extensions** (1), fai clic sulla freccia in alto a destra (2) e scegli **Install from Disk…**."

#: (2)/Documentation/windowgen-documentation-4.0/docs/source/starting_up.rst:24
#: DESKTOP-HETTM96/WindowGen
msgid "Navigate to the folder where you saved the WindowGen zip archive, select it and press **Install from Disk**. Do not unpack the archive."
msgstr "Vai nella cartella in cui hai salvato l'archivio zip di WindowGen, selezionalo e premi **Install from Disk**. Non estrarre l'archivio."

#: (2)/Documentation/windowgen-documentation-4.0/docs/source/starting_up.rst:26
#: DESKTOP-HETTM96/WindowGen
msgid "WindowGen is enabled automatically. You can find it in the **Add-ons** section, where its preferences are located as well."
msgstr "WindowGen si attiva automaticamente. Lo trovi nella sezione **Add-ons**, dove si trovano anche le sue preferenze."

#: (2)/Documentation/windowgen-documentation-4.0/docs/source/starting_up.rst:31
#: DESKTOP-HETTM96/WindowGen
msgid "Close the Preferences window. Press **N** in the 3D Viewport to open the side panel and select the **WindowGen** tab."
msgstr "Chiudi la finestra delle preferenze. Premi **N** nel viewport 3D per aprire il pannello laterale e scegli la scheda **WindowGen**."

#: (2)/Documentation/windowgen-documentation-4.0/docs/source/starting_up.rst:37
#: DESKTOP-HETTM96/WindowGen
msgid "Updating from WindowGen 3"
msgstr "Aggiornare da WindowGen 3"

#: (2)/Documentation/windowgen-documentation-4.0/docs/source/starting_up.rst:39
#: DESKTOP-HETTM96/WindowGen
msgid "Install WindowGen 4 as described above. It replaces the previous version; there is no need to remove WindowGen 3 first."
msgstr "Installa WindowGen 4 come descritto sopra. Sostituisce la versione precedente; non serve disinstallare prima WindowGen 3."

#: (2)/Documentation/windowgen-documentation-4.0/docs/source/starting_up.rst:40
#: DESKTOP-HETTM96/WindowGen
msgid "Open your project and press **Update WindowGen in This File** in the *Add Window* panel. See :doc:`working_with_generator` for details."
msgstr "Apri il progetto e premi **Update WindowGen in This File** nel pannello *Add Window*. Per i dettagli vedi :doc:`working_with_generator`."

#: (2)/Documentation/windowgen-documentation-4.0/docs/source/starting_up.rst:42
#: DESKTOP-HETTM96/WindowGen
msgid "Your windows keep all of their settings."
msgstr "Le tue finestre mantengono tutte le impostazioni."

